    <textarea data-f="text" id="fsay-text" rows="3" placeholder="e.g. “Alan, Tomas didn't show, scaffold's idle” · “Sarah, is the beam drop 2 or 3 inches, sheet A-301” · “Chen, insulation isn't here, need it Monday” · “Received the LVP, it's in the garden by the door” · “Log: inspector opened four tiles”">${esc(draft)}</textarea>
