/* ---------- HUB CORE (hub_core.js) — the Sales group rebuilt on HubSpot Sales Hub's model ----------
   Objects: Contacts, Companies, Deals (the leads), Tasks, Activities (notes, emails, calls, meetings), Quotes (estimates),
   Line items, Playbooks, Sequences. Index pages: saved views as tabs, quick-filter pills, Advanced filters, search,
   Board / Table, Edit columns, sortable headers, bulk bar, pagination, preview panel, Create side panel.
   Record page: three columns — left (name, action row, About with inline edit), middle (data highlights, stage tracker,
   Overview / Activities with Activity · Notes · Emails · Calls · Tasks · Meetings, Upcoming, the timeline), right
   (association cards with + Add). Pipelines with stage probabilities and required stage properties; custom properties
   on every object. SmartDesign's content — the stages, the building, the playbook — lives inside it. */

