function hbPropWizard(obj, p){ const x = p || {label:'', name:'', type:'text', group:'Custom', options:[], description:''}; hbPanel(p ? 'Edit property' : 'Create property', `${mbF('Object', mbSel('obj', [[obj, HB_OBJ[obj].label]], obj))}${mbF('Group', mbIn('group', x.group, 'Custom, SmartDesign, Deal information'))}${mbF('Label', mbIn('label', x.label, ''))}${mbF('Description', mbIn('description', x.description || '', ''))}${mbF('Field type', mbSel('type', [['text','Single-line text'],['textarea','Multi-line text'],['number','Number'],['money','Currency'],['date','Date picker'],['select','Dropdown select'],['multi','Multiple checkboxes'],['bool','Single checkbox'],['user','HubSpot user']], x.type))}${mbF('Options (dropdown / checkboxes) — one per line', `<textarea data-f="options" rows="4">${esc((x.options || []).join('\n'))}</textarea>`)}<label class="chk"><input type="checkbox" data-f="req" ${x.req ? 'checked' : ''}> Required when creating</label><label class="chk"><input type="checkbox" data-f="addAbout" ${p ? '' : 'checked'}> Show on the About card</label><label class="chk"><input type="checkbox" data-f="addCol"> Add as a column in the default view</label>`, {submit:p ? 'Save' : 'Create', onSubmit:f => { if (!f.label){ hbToast('A label'); return false; } const name = p ? p.name : 'custom_' + f.label.toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]+/g, '_').replace(/^_|_$/g, ''); if (!p && hbProp(obj, name)){ hbToast('A property with that name exists'); return false; } const def = Object.assign(p || {}, {name, label:f.label, type:f.type, group:f.group || 'Custom', description:f.description, options:f.options.split('\n').map(s => s.trim()).filter(Boolean), req:f.req, by:hbMe()}); if (!p) DB.hub.customProps[obj].push(def); if (f.addAbout){ const a = DB.hub.about[obj] = (DB.hub.about[obj] || HB_ABOUT[obj]).slice(); if (!a.includes(name)) a.push(name); } if (f.addCol){ const v = DB.hub.views[obj][0]; v.columns = (v.columns || HB_DEFAULT_COLS[obj]).concat([name]); } save(); renderHbSettings(); hbToast(p ? 'Property saved' : 'Property created — it can be filtered, reported and shown anywhere'); }}); }
function hbProductPanel(p){ const x = p || {name:'', sku:'', description:'', price:'', cost:'', freq:'One-time', folder:''}; hbPanel(p ? 'Edit product' : 'Create product', `${mbF('Name', mbIn('name', x.name, ''))}<div class="grid2">${mbF('SKU', mbIn('sku', x.sku, ''))}${mbF('Folder', mbIn('folder', x.folder, ''))}</div>${mbF('Description', `<textarea data-f="description" rows="2">${esc(x.description)}</textarea>`)}<div class="grid2">${mbF('Unit price', mbIn('price', x.price, '', 'number'))}${mbF('Unit cost', mbIn('cost', x.cost, '', 'number'))}</div>${mbF('Billing frequency', mbSel('freq', ['One-time','Monthly','Quarterly','Annually'], x.freq))}`, {submit:p ? 'Save' : 'Create', onSubmit:f => { if (!f.name) return false; f.price = +f.price || 0; f.cost = +f.cost || 0; if (p) Object.assign(p, f); else DB.hub.products.push(Object.assign({id:uid('pd')}, f)); save(); renderHbSettings(); }}); }
